# Portfolio configuration
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own values.
# NOTE: This is a static HTML site, so there is no build step that reads .env.
# The values below are mirrored in assets/js/config.js (window.PORTFOLIO_CONFIG).
# Edit assets/js/config.js to keep contact details in one place.

